#: ../../chapter02.rst:3
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:7
msgid ""
"If this is the very first time you are installing |prodname| server, it "
"is recommended that you do the all-in-one installation by preparing a "
"clean Windows 2025/2022/2019 virtual machine and installing with all"
" the default parameters. The All-in-one deployment is the smallest fully "
"functional setup and can be used for production environment with < 1000 "
"users."
msgstr "Hvis dette er første gang, du installerer |prodname| server, anbefales det, at du foretager en alt-i-én-installation ved at forberede en ren Windows 2025/2022/2019 virtuel maskine og installere med alle standardparametrene. Alt-i-én-udrulningen er den mindste fuldt funktionsdygtige opsætning og kan bruges til produktionsmiljø med < 1000 brugere."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:11
msgid "Step 1: Prepare the File Storage"
msgstr "Trin 1: Forbered filopbevaringen"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:13
msgid ""
"|prodname| server is about to cloudify your file storage and enable "
"remote and mobile access, with sync and share capability. So, the first "
"question is: What is your file storage solution?"
msgstr "|prodname| server er ved at skyificere din filopbevaring og muliggøre fjern- og mobiladgang med synkroniserings- og delingskapacitet. Så det første spørgsmål er: Hvad er din filopbevaringsløsning?"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:15
msgid ""
"Your file storage can be a Windows File Server network share or any "
"storage devices that supports CIFS/SMB protocol. It can also be from "
"iSCSI devices that you can mount storage directly as a drive letter in "
"the |prodname| server. It can also be a container inside a private "
"instance of OpenStack Swift, a bucket in Amazon S3 compatible storage, or"
" a container from Windows Azure blob storage. You will need the basic "
"access information ready. For example,"
msgstr "Din filopbevaring kan være et Windows File Server netværksdrev eller enhver lagringsenhed, der understøtter CIFS/SMB-protokollen. Det kan også være fra iSCSI-enheder, hvor du kan montere lageret direkte som et drevbogstav i |prodname|-serveren. Det kan også være en container inde i en privat instans af OpenStack Swift, en spand i Amazon S3-kompatibel opbevaring eller en container fra Windows Azure blob opbevaring. Du skal have de grundlæggende adgangsoplysninger klar. For eksempel,"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:17
msgid "**Windows File Server**"
msgstr "**Windows-filserver**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:19
msgid ""
"If it is a Windows File Server, you will need the UNC path to the network"
" share and the user credentials for accessing the folder."
msgstr "Hvis det er en Windows-filserver, skal du bruge UNC-stien til netværksdelen og brugeroplysningerne til at få adgang til mappen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:21
msgid ""
"If it is from a local C: drive or local D: drive, you will need a local "
"user credential that has full permission to the local folder."
msgstr "Hvis det er fra et lokalt C: drev eller lokalt D: drev, skal du bruge en lokal brugerkonto, der har fuld tilladelse til den lokale mappe."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:23
msgid "**OpenStack Swift**"
msgstr "**OpenStack Swift**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:25
msgid ""
"If it is OpenStack Swift, you will need the authentication URL and "
"credentials and understand the version of your authentication setup, such"
" as KeyStone V2 or KeyStone V3 or just the classic authentication."
msgstr "Hvis det er OpenStack Swift, skal du bruge godkendelses-URL'en og legitimationsoplysningerne og forstå versionen af din godkendelsesopsætning, såsom KeyStone V2 eller KeyStone V3 eller bare den klassiske godkendelse."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:27
msgid "**Amazon S3**"
msgstr "**Amazon S3**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:29
msgid ""
"If it is Amazon S3, you will need the Access Key and Secret Key and a "
"Bucket Name. If the Access Key and Secret Key is from an IAM user, you "
"will need to make sure the IAM user has full permission to the bucket."
msgstr "Hvis det er Amazon S3, skal du bruge adgangsnøglen og den hemmelige nøgle samt et spandenavn. Hvis adgangsnøglen og den hemmelige nøgle er fra en IAM-bruger, skal du sørge for, at IAM-brugeren har fuld tilladelse til spanden."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:31
msgid "**Windows Azure Blob Storage**"
msgstr "**Windows Azure Blob Opbevaring**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:33
msgid ""
"You will need the \"Storage Account Name\" and the \"Primary Key\" and a "
"container name."
msgstr "Du skal bruge \"Storage Account Name\" og \"Primary Key\" samt et container-navn."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:37
msgid ""
"The initial deployment of |prodname| configures the back end storage to "
"use the ``C:\\CentreStack`` directory on the |prodname| server. This "
"default back end storage location can be changed to another location at a"
" later time by modifying the back end storage of the default tenant. Each"
" |prodname| tenant can be configured for different back end storage "
"locations."
msgstr "Den indledende udrulning af |prodname| konfigurerer backend-lagringen til at bruge ``C:\CentreStack``-mappen på |prodname|-serveren. Denne standardplacering for backend-lagring kan ændres til en anden placering på et senere tidspunkt ved at ændre backend-lagringen for den standardlejer. Hver |prodname|-lejer kan konfigureres til forskellige backend-lagringsplaceringer."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:40
msgid "Step 2: Prepare Active Directory (Optional)"
msgstr "Trin 2: Forbered Active Directory (Valgfrit)"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:42
msgid ""
"If you are integrating Active Directory, you will need the following "
"information:"
msgstr "Hvis du integrerer Active Directory, skal du bruge følgende oplysninger:"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:44
msgid "The DNS name (or IP address) of an Active Directory Domain Controller."
msgstr "DNS-navnet (eller IP-adressen) på en Active Directory-domænecontroller."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:45
msgid "A service account that can access the Active Directory."
msgstr "En tjenestekonto, der kan få adgang til Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:46
msgid "The DNS name of the Active Directory Domain."
msgstr "DNS-navnet på Active Directory-domænet."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:50
msgid ""
"If your Active Directory or the client's Active Directory is remotely "
"located with regard to the |prodname| Server, then you should use Server "
"Agent software to connect the Active Directory instead of using LDAP to "
"connect Active Directory."
msgstr "Hvis dit Active Directory eller klientens Active Directory er placeret fjernt i forhold til |prodname| Serveren, så bør du bruge Server Agent software til at forbinde Active Directory i stedet for at bruge LDAP til at forbinde Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:54
msgid ""
"If you are using Single Sign-On service such as Azure AD, Active "
"Directory Federation Service, OneLogin or OKTA, you can confige SAML "
"based authentication instead of using Active Directory directly. Normally"
" those identity service providers are connected to the corporate Active "
"Directory anyway."
msgstr "Hvis du bruger Single Sign-On-tjenester som Azure AD, Active Directory Federation Service, OneLogin eller OKTA, kan du konfigurere SAML-baseret autentificering i stedet for at bruge Active Directory direkte. Normalt er disse identitetstjenesteudbydere alligevel forbundet til virksomhedens Active Directory."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:57
msgid "Step 3: Prepare the Database Server"
msgstr "Trin 3: Forbered databaseserveren"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:61
msgid ""
"If you are installing the all-in-one instance, you can skip this step "
"because the all-in-one installer will install a PostgreSQL and configure "
"the database accordingly. See `Step 5: Start Installation`_ below for "
"more about the all-in-one installation."
msgstr "Hvis du installerer all-in-one-instansen, kan du springe dette trin over, fordi all-in-one-installationsprogrammet vil installere en PostgreSQL og konfigurere databasen tilsvarende. Se `Trin 5: Start installation`_ nedenfor for mere om all-in-one-installationen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:63
msgid ""
"This step is only for installation that has a separate database node "
"which is not installed by default with any worker node."
msgstr "Dette trin er kun for installation, der har en separat database node, som ikke er installeret som standard med nogen arbejder node."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:65
msgid ""
"All |prodname| servers in a cluster will share one single centralized "
"database."
msgstr "Alle |prodname| servere i en klynge vil dele en enkelt centraliseret database."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:69
msgid ""
"With the release of the |prodname| version 9.5.5409.41172, the default "
"database engine for the \"all in one\" deployment has switched to "
"PostgreSQL as opposed to Microsoft SQL Server Express Edition. The main "
"reason to make this switch was to avoid the built-in limitations of SQL "
"Server Express Edition (1 GB RAM and 10 GB max database file size)."
msgstr "Med udgivelsen af |prodname| version 9.5.5409.41172 er standarddatabase-motoren for \"all in one\"-installationen skiftet til PostgreSQL i stedet for Microsoft SQL Server Express Edition. Hovedårsagen til dette skifte var at undgå de indbyggede begrænsninger i SQL Server Express Edition (1 GB RAM og 10 GB maksimal databasefilstørrelse)."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:71
msgid ""
"There are two places that store persistent information. The first place "
"is the File Storage mentioned in Step 1. The second place is the "
"|prodname| database. There is configuration information such as user "
"name, team folder, shared folder, login token in the database. There is "
"also runtime information such as audit trace and file change log in the "
"database."
msgstr "Der er to steder, der gemmer vedvarende information. Det første sted er Filopbevaringen nævnt i Trin 1. Det andet sted er |prodname| databasen. Der er konfigurationsinformation såsom brugernavn, teammappe, delt mappe, login token i databasen. Der er også kørselsinformation såsom revisionspor og filændringslog i databasen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:73
msgid ""
"The default |prodname| deployment utilizes a PostgreSQL local database on"
" the |prodname| Server. We provide this option to allow the trial "
"installation to be as simple as possible."
msgstr "Den standard |prodname| installation anvender en lokal PostgreSQL-database på |prodname| Serveren. Vi tilbyder denne mulighed for at gøre prøveinstallationen så enkel som mulig."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:75
msgid ""
"Currently |prodname| supports PostgreSQL, MySQL or Microsoft SQL Server "
"Database Management Systems (DBMS). Some good reasons for deploying an "
"external database server are performance, scalability and/or high "
"availability."
msgstr "I øjeblikket understøtter |prodname| PostgreSQL, MySQL eller Microsoft SQL Server Database Management Systems (DBMS). Nogle gode grunde til at implementere en ekstern databaseserver er ydeevne, skalerbarhed og/eller høj tilgængelighed."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:78
msgid "Microsoft SQL Server"
msgstr "Microsoft SQL Server"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:79
msgid ""
"If you are using an external Microsoft SQL Server as opposed to the "
"default MySQL all-in-one deployment, then you must ensure the **SQL "
"Server Authentication is configured for Mixed Mode Authentication**. The "
"|prodname| Server connection requires the use of a SQL account, not a "
"Windows integrated authentication account."
msgstr "Hvis du bruger en ekstern Microsoft SQL Server i stedet for den standard MySQL all-in-one-udrulning, skal du sikre dig, at **SQL Server-godkendelsen er konfigureret til Mixed Mode Authentication**. |prodname| Server-forbindelsen kræver brug af en SQL-konto, ikke en Windows integreret godkendelseskonto."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:81
msgid ""
"During the setup of the first worker node, the installer will need to "
"create a database, create tables inside the database and create stored "
"procedures in the database. Therefore, it requires a SQL security account"
" that has enough privileges for the installation."
msgstr "Under opsætningen af den første arbejder node, vil installatøren have brug for at oprette en database, oprette tabeller inde i databasen og oprette lagrede procedurer i databasen. Derfor kræver det en SQL-sikkerhedskonto, der har nok privilegier til installationen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:83
msgid ""
"If the database server is external to the |prodname| server, make sure "
"TCP protocol is enabled and firewall is opened to accept SQL connections."
" Default TCP port is 1433 and that port needs to be opened on firewall. "
"If you have SQL Server listening on a different port, that port will need"
" to be opened as well."
msgstr "Hvis databaseserveren er ekstern i forhold til |prodname| serveren, skal du sørge for, at TCP-protokollen er aktiveret, og at firewallen er åben for at acceptere SQL-forbindelser. Standard TCP-porten er 1433, og den port skal være åben i firewallen. Hvis du har SQL Server, der lytter på en anden port, skal den port også åbnes."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:86
msgid "MySQL Server"
msgstr "MySQL-server"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:87
msgid ""
"MySQL typically listens on TCP port 3306. Make sure this port is opened "
"on the firewall."
msgstr "MySQL lytter typisk på TCP-port 3306. Sørg for, at denne port er åben på firewallen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:90
msgid "PostgreSQL Server"
msgstr "PostgreSQL Server"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:91
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL usually is the default option for the all-in-one installation."
" The default port is 5679 but most of the time the database is running on"
" the \"localhost\", same as the |prodname| server."
msgstr "PostgreSQL er som regel standardvalget for all-in-one-installationen. Standardporten er 5679, men det meste af tiden kører databasen på \"localhost\", det samme som |prodname| serveren."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:95
msgid "Step 4: Prepare the |prodname| Server"
msgstr "Trin 4: Forbered |prodname| Serveren"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:97
msgid ""
"The easiest way to prepare the |prodname| server is to have a clean "
"Windows Server 2025/2022/2019 OS with English locale and make sure "
"the worker nodes are all in the same time zone."
msgstr "Den nemmeste måde at forberede |prodname| serveren på er at have en ren Windows Server 2025/2022/2019 OS med engelsk landestandard og sørge for at arbejdsnodernes tidszoner er ens."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:99
msgid ""
"We recommend Windows server 2025, 2022, or 2019 as a "
"preferred server OS running on a virtual machine."
msgstr "Vi anbefaler Windows Server 2025, 2022 eller 2019 som et foretrukket server-OS, der kører på en virtuel maskine."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:105
msgid "**Supported Operating Systems**"
msgstr "**Understøttede operativsystemer**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:102
msgid "Windows Server 2025"
msgstr "Windows Server 2025"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:103
msgid "Windows Server 2022"
msgstr "Windows Server 2022"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:104
msgid "Windows Server 2019"
msgstr "Windows Server 2019"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:107
msgid "**Supported CPU**"
msgstr "**Understøttet CPU**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:108
msgid "64-bit Intel or AMD x64 architecture"
msgstr "64-bit Intel eller AMD x64 arkitektur"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:109
msgid "2 - virtual CPUs minimum (4 - virtual CPUs or more are recommended)"
msgstr "2 - virtuelle CPU'er minimum (4 - virtuelle CPU'er eller flere anbefales)"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:111
msgid "**Memory**"
msgstr "**Hukommelse**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:112
msgid "8GB RAM minimum (16 GB or more is preferred)"
msgstr "8 GB RAM minimum (16 GB eller mere foretrækkes)"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:115
msgid "**Hard Disk space**"
msgstr "**Harddiskplads**"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:115
msgid ""
"100 GB minimum, preferably SSD. This assumes back end file storage is not"
" located on the |prodname| server itself."
msgstr "100 GB minimum, helst SSD. Dette antager, at backend-filopbevaringen ikke er placeret på |prodname| serveren selv."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:118
msgid "Step 5: Start Installation"
msgstr "Trin 5: Start installationen"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:120
msgid ""
"You can get the |prodname| installation package from the |prodname| "
"partner portal (by logging in to https://partner.centrestack.com/login/) "
"and going to the Self-Hosted |prodname| section."
msgstr "Du kan få |prodname| installationspakken fra |prodname| partnerportalen (ved at logge ind på https://partner.centrestack.com/login/) og gå til sektionen Self-Hosted |prodname|."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:124
msgid ""
"Sign into the |prodname| server console (RDP or physical console are "
"fine) with administrator rights. Once you click the **\"Download\"** "
"button on the Partner Portal, the installer will appear either in "
"downloads or as a link at the bottom of your browser. Click the "
"executable file to begin the installation."
msgstr "Log ind på |prodname| serverkonsollen (RDP eller fysisk konsol er fint) med administratorrettigheder. Når du klikker på **\"Download\"** knappen på Partner Portalen, vil installationsprogrammet enten fremgå i downloads eller som et link i bunden af din browser. Klik på den eksekverbare fil for at starte installationen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:126
msgid "You will see the welcome screen."
msgstr "Du vil se velkomstskærmen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:130 ../../chapter02.rst:136
msgid "Click 'Next'"
msgstr "Klik på 'Næste'"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:132
msgid "And accept the EULA"
msgstr "Og accepter EULA'en"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:140
msgid "And Click Install."
msgstr "Og klik på Installer."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:144
msgid ""
"After the installation has been completed successfully, a reboot is "
"required. Click 'Restart'."
msgstr "Efter installationen er fuldført, er en genstart nødvendig. Klik på 'Genstart'."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:148
msgid ""
"|prodname| will install and then you will need to restart your system to "
"complete the installation."
msgstr "|prodname| vil installere, og derefter skal du genstarte dit system for at fuldføre installationen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:152
msgid ""
"|prodname| is a multi-tenant solution. The Tenant Manager scope is "
"defined for a tenant administrator. For a multi-tenant Cluster Server "
"system, each tenant has an administrator. For a single-tenant Cluster "
"Server system, the default cluster administrator is also the tenant "
"administrator."
msgstr "|prodname| er en multi-tenant-løsning. Tenant Manager-omfanget er defineret for en tenantadministrator. I et multi-tenant Cluster Server-system har hver tenant en administrator. For et single-tenant Cluster Server-system er standard clusteradministratoren også tenantadministratoren."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:156
msgid ""
"After the reboot and login to the Windows session again with the same "
"Windows admin user credential, it may take 3-5 minutes before all the "
"windows services start and a web browser page will pop-up."
msgstr "Efter genstarten og login til Windows-sessionen igen med det samme Windows admin-brugerlogin, kan det tage 3-5 minutter før alle Windows-tjenesterne starter, og en webside vil poppe op."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:159
msgid ""
"For the next screen, if you have an existing database use the pull-down "
"menu to select a different option otherwise use the default which will "
"also install the PostgreSQL Community Edition database."
msgstr "På den næste skærm, hvis du har en eksisterende database, brug rullemenuen til at vælge en anden mulighed, ellers brug standardindstillingen, som også vil installere PostgreSQL Community Edition-databasen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:163
msgid ""
"In the next screen, enter your Partner Account login credentials to "
"complete the installation."
msgstr "På den næste skærm skal du indtaste dine Partner Account loginoplysninger for at fuldføre installationen."

